abstract: >-
  A descriptive study of initial-public-offering (IPO) returns for issuers in the
  United States and Europe (including the UK), using WRDS data together with Jay
  Ritter's public IPO data. The repository contains the reproducible analysis
  pipeline, a Quarto-to-Beamer slide deck of key findings, and a short descriptive
  note documenting the data sources, situating the work in the IPO literature, and
  reporting the results.

